              <calculation class='tableau' formula='(SUM([Deflection rate Current (copy)_640214839339683844]) - SUM([Deflection rate Previous (copy)_640214839340007429]))/&#10;SUM([Deflection rate Previous (copy)_640214839340007429])' />
